  "summary": "Javier Milei attributes his realization of freedom's economic value to observing historical GDP growth patterns that defied traditional neoclassical economic assumptions about monopolies. By examining 2,000 years of data showing explosive post-1800 productivity alongside falling extreme poverty, he recognized a fundamental contradiction in economic theory regarding living standards and market structures.",
